{"steam_appid":1094390,"steam_name":"Waltz of the Wizard","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1094390/780365/7940db01fb7841fc12d5f92731c9137cbf51af9f/1750618125/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765981327","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257070308/1638ae613ead7f2aeb693a4151265b7c44bb167d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1765981327","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/64548acbdb573973f81115f1a9caf98313f60d91/ss_64548acbdb573973f81115f1a9caf98313f60d91.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785590469","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/a33ca24231534bdf30710ba69596d81f2aac7701/ss_a33ca24231534bdf30710ba69596d81f2aac7701.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785590469","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/9916d1937ebb598780385cca54bed5972bac188b/ss_9916d1937ebb598780385cca54bed5972bac188b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785590469","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/df2972b70f819077c87e53e68efab8506f449df2/ss_df2972b70f819077c87e53e68efab8506f449df2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785590469","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/a163e05918b1a09047543a412e455e210ffa8c6a/ss_a163e05918b1a09047543a412e455e210ffa8c6a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785590469"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waltz of the Wizard is a sandbox mixed with a story in an ultra-interactive world, where you journey through a fantastical realm full of mischief, mayhem and mildly sarcastic characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/7e340df188b4f668e54b6364ec70c7db.avif?t=1785590469\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras_big/7e340df188b4f668e54b6364ec70c7db.webp?t=1785590469 width=1560 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/d3e87309fe8bd8913a7bfbe4f2ccddcc.avif?t=1785590469\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras_big/d3e87309fe8bd8913a7bfbe4f2ccddcc.webp?t=1785590469 width=1560 height=349 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/c093eb38621c41aae78f7d40f73a5950.avif?t=1785590469\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras_big/c093eb38621c41aae78f7d40f73a5950.webp?t=1785590469 width=1560 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/3cba3c782dd1c7beaa22feac771dca94.poster.avif?t=1785590469\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/3cba3c782dd1c7beaa22feac771dca94.webm?t=1785590469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/3cba3c782dd1c7beaa22feac771dca94.mp4?t=1785590469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skully is an on-device AI character that features thousands of voice-acted dialogues and an enormous range of unique reactions. Skully is intensely aware—responding not just to <strong>what you say</strong>, but also your <strong>gaze, gestures, and every weird thing that happens in the environment</strong>. Interact with Skully for a delightfully mischievous experience where even the most playful actions can trigger <strong>hilariously dark and unexpected outcomes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/5ec008b4f142b261738a5566f8569f0d.avif?t=1785590469\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras_big/5ec008b4f142b261738a5566f8569f0d.webp?t=1785590469 width=1560 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/e945c80adbd531595baf3951ad7c6a17.poster.avif?t=1785590469\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/e945c80adbd531595baf3951ad7c6a17.webm?t=1785590469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/e945c80adbd531595baf3951ad7c6a17.mp4?t=1785590469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your magic abilities are dazzlingly diverse; summon storms of fireballs, manipulate time,  transform objects into frogs, master natural magic particles. Discover mystical artifacts and spellbinding objects each reacting uniquely to your interactions such as ancient relics that whisper, potions that turn you into a giant to name a few.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/3891280f84079c33ab75f21f8ece505e.avif?t=1785590469\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras_big/3891280f84079c33ab75f21f8ece505e.webp?t=1785590469 width=1560 height=89 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/caa0d757021578f9f6be02fee6032c08.poster.avif?t=1785590469\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/caa0d757021578f9f6be02fee6032c08.webm?t=1785590469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/caa0d757021578f9f6be02fee6032c08.mp4?t=1785590469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/278ab261693b303186df217296c90340.avif?t=1785590469\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras_big/278ab261693b303186df217296c90340.webp?t=1785590469 width=1560 height=349 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use voice interactions with blazingly fast responsiveness to talk to characters or use voice commands to magically modify anything to your heart's desire - where you just need to be careful not to break the reality if you go to far! For those who prefer to remain silent there is always the optional Type to Talk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/448b332f7faeb7c2140b5e4aa5514785.avif?t=1785590469\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras_big/448b332f7faeb7c2140b5e4aa5514785.webp?t=1785590469 width=1560 height=89 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/ad8befa899a1ce4ae0be17137ce568ef.poster.avif?t=1785590469\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/ad8befa899a1ce4ae0be17137ce568ef.webm?t=1785590469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/ad8befa899a1ce4ae0be17137ce568ef.mp4?t=1785590469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/8d07c49096b7829cedf98bf750f89822.avif?t=1785590469\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras_big/8d07c49096b7829cedf98bf750f89822.webp?t=1785590469 width=1560 height=349 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a fantasy world filled with bizarre curiosities, hilarious secrets and many hours of gameplay. Whether you’re navigating Skully’s past memories, hunting for glory in the Observer Fortress, or strapping Skully to some unstable medieval rockets, get ready for a journey defined by pure, whimsical weirdness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/0527d3664f0054996cacebf93590cc98.avif?t=1785590469\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras_big/0527d3664f0054996cacebf93590cc98.webp?t=1785590469 width=1560 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/94a882052057e403f7a129d454574f87.avif?t=1785590469\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras_big/94a882052057e403f7a129d454574f87.webp?t=1785590469 width=1560 height=349 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waltz of the Wizard has greatly expanded with multiple  updates since the original release! Each update has introduced something totally new, often experiemental and always new content, more to do with Skully and many new secrets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras/daf37d576626a5adcad9d27a216e20c2.avif?t=1785590469\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1094390/extras_big/daf37d576626a5adcad9d27a216e20c2.webp?t=1785590469 width=1560 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆  Top #30 Best Selling Quest Game of All Time - <i>Meta</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⭐️ Featured in &quot;New Games We Love&quot; - <i>Apple Editors</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 Winner of Best Updated Game - <i>UploadVR</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⭐️ “Exceptionally well-received” - <i>Rolling Stone Magazine</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏆 Winner of Best Innovation - <i>NYX Game Awards</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⭐️ “Aldin helped pioneer VR as we know it today” - <i>Road to VR</i></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4590 / AMD FX 8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 970 / AMD Radeon R9 290<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Valve Index, Meta Quest (link), Rift S, Vive, Vive Pro</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7-4790<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Valve Index or Meta Quest (link)</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie","RPG","Simulation"],"developers":["Aldin Dynamics"],"publishers":["Aldin Dynamics"],"release_date":"10 Jul, 2019"}